  m_Name: Note_CultistsNote
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  NoteName: CrewmatesDoubt
  NoteHeader: Crewmates Diary (3/3)
  NoteText: "Day 9\nThey\u2019ve started a church to worship that thing. holding
    rituals, sacrificing people..\nBut this forsaken thing they worship, it's never
    responded, never given them anything in return, only taken more and more, their
    sanity.. their lives..\n\nYet they keep going.. maybe because they've given up
    on escape, or maybe its for a reason I don't understand..<color=#D2C2A1><size=50%>
    I can't understand<color=#3C3424><size=100%>\n\nWhatever that THING is, it's
    taken their minds, and if they find out it hasn't taken mine too, they're going
    offer me to-\r"
